## 3. Core Style Rules

- {Primary color} is an accent, never overwhelming.
- One dominant hero object.
- Every secondary element supports the hero.
- Premium feeling comes from restraint, spacing, and lighting.
- Typography should feel {editorial/luxury/modern/etc.}.
- Use cinematic lighting with subtle reflections and depth.
- CTA should be visually distinct while remaining elegant.

