## 5. Negative Prompt

Avoid:

### Visual Clutter
- overcrowded compositions
- too many props
- visual noise
- unnecessary decorative elements

### Lighting
- flat lighting
- harsh front lighting
- weak shadows
- inconsistent reflections

### Color
- oversaturated palettes
- rainbow gradients
- excessive neon
- muddy metallics

### Typography
- generic stock fonts
- heavy drop shadows
- bevel effects
- cheap-looking text treatments

### Objects
- low-poly geometry
- plastic-looking materials
- poor reflections
- duplicated props
- irrelevant decorative assets

### Composition
- multiple focal points
- buried CTA
- poor spacing
- busy backgrounds
- unbalanced layouts

### Style
- generic industry clichés
- stock-image appearance
- cartoon styling
- amateur rendering quality

---

